{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测账号 Kerberos 预认证被关闭，便于 AS-REP Roasting。对应需求：修改账号属性。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows账号关闭Kerberos预认证","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n账号被设置为不要求 Kerberos 预认证。\n\n### 为何重要\n攻击者可离线爆破 AS-REP。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认操作者与目标账号。\n2. 目标是否高权限。\n3. 立即重新启用预认证并轮换密码。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","references":["https://harmj0y.medium.com/roasting-as-reps-e6179a65216b","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/security/threat-protection/auditing/event-4738","https://github.com/atc-project/atomic-threat-coverage/blob/master/Atomic_Threat_Coverage/Logging_Policies/LP_0026_windows_audit_user_account_management.md"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"e514d8cd-ed15-4011-84e2-d15147e059f1","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用对应数据源（Elastic Defend / System / Windows / auditd，按规则说明）。\n2. 机器学习规则需关联 ML job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","对应需求: 修改账号属性"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"any where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.code == \"4738\" and\n  winlog.event_data.NewUACList == \"USER_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1558","name":"Steal or Forge Kerberos Tickets","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1558.004","name":"AS-REP Roasting","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE A